--[[
    SketchPanelUI v1
    A separate Roblox/Luau UI library inspired by the supplied sketch.

    Main ideas:
      - detached header card
      - rounded dark main panel
      - cyan accent line along the bottom edges
      - vertical Lucide tab list on the left
      - large scrollable content canvas on the right
      - configurable text styling on Tabs/Sections/elements
      - all core elements from the previous library:
          Tab, TabDivider, Section, Button, Checkbox, Toggle, Keybind,
          Slider, Dropdown, Input, Colorpicker, Paragraph, Code,
          Divider, Space, Tag, Notification, Dialog, Popup
      - RightShift visibility toggle
      - precise decimal Slider Increment/Step support
      - global Colorpicker popup with one-at-a-time behavior
      - swipe notifications

    This library only creates UI and callback plumbing.
]]

